{"publicId":"9c008a39-db43-407c-8b15-5ab298fc6dc6","title":"Simon Willison发布Datasette Lite新版本：支持多版本SQLite及插件安装","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T16:48:33.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T16:48:33.000Z","digest":"Simon Willison于2026-11-18发布Datasette Lite 2.0版本，通过服务工作者和WebAssembly实现浏览器端运行，支持指定版本SQLite（需明确版本号）及无限次插件安装（通过多次传入&install=...参数）。该版本与真实服务器端应用高度一致，插件加载规则和CORS实现方式已更新：插件需通过Gist托管（因Gist提供开放CORS头），且完整参数说明见README文档。早先版本（2026-11-17）仅支持单次插件安装和本地文件托管。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T18:23:43.835Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Datasette Lite 服务工作者与Pyodide支持多版本SQLite及插件安装","latestReport":{"id":"yy61p9xu52kdvkk417sm99qbx"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fPQxPCKQnQgw","title":"Datasette Lite 的新版本","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T16:48:33.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"yy61p9xu52kdvkk417sm99qbx","title":"Datasette Lite 服务工作者与Pyodide支持多版本SQLite及插件安装","summary":"Datasette Lite 通过服务工作者和WebAssembly实现浏览器端运行，支持指定版本SQLite及多插件安装，便于本地调试与演示。示例URL展示如何通过参数加载特定插件、数据库和元数据，并对比不同SQLite版本执行结果的差异。","source":{"name":"Simon Willison","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T16:48:33.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"yy61p9xu52kdvkk417sm99qbx","title":"Datasette Lite 服务工作者与Pyodide支持多版本SQLite及插件安装","summary":"Datasette Lite 通过服务工作者和WebAssembly实现浏览器端运行，支持指定版本SQLite及多插件安装，便于本地调试与演示。示例URL展示如何通过参数加载特定插件、数据库和元数据，并对比不同SQLite版本执行结果的差异。","source":{"name":"Simon Willison","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T16:48:33.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T00:00